title: Juventudes Socialistas
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: juventudes_timer <= 0
card-image: img/juventudes_libertarias.jpg
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; juventudes_timer += 6; js_militarization_cost = 2 if js_militancy > 0.1 else js_militarization_cost = 1; js_militarization_cost = 3 if js_militancy > 0.25
max-visits: 6
#subtitle: Youth organization of the PSOE.

= Juventudes Socialistas

The *Socialist Youth* is the youth organization of the Spanish Socialist Workers' Party (PSOE). Headquartered in Madrid, the organization was founded in 1906. 

[? if workers_psoe < 46 or workers_psoe < workers_ap or workers_psoe < workers_pce : The Juventudes Socialistas is having a more difficult time recruiting, as the PSOE is no longer the dominant party among the workers. Many of its members have left. ?]

- @militant: Fund more military-style training and equipment for the Juventudes Socialistas.
- @militant_2: Use our existing resources to support more training for the Juventudes Socialistas.
- @same: Keep the Juventudes Socialistas as it is.
- @cut_js: Cut funding for the Juventudes Socialistas.
- @women_js
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

#- Orient reichsbanner towards anti-fascism (only available if we have prioritized anti fascism)

@militant
choose-if: resources >= js_militarization_cost
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources ([+ js_militarization_cost +] needed).
subtitle: -[+ js_militarization_cost +] resources
on-arrival: resources -= js_militarization_cost; js_investment += 1; js_strength += 100; js_militancy += 0.05; caballeristas_strength += 2; caballeristas_dissent -= 2; prietistas_dissent += 2; psoe_militancy += 0.05; workers_psoe += 2*(1-dissent); unemployed_psoe += 2*(1-dissent); prr_relation -= 5

Some in our party decry the increasing militarization of the Juventudes Socialistas. They say it is emulating the right-wing nationalists or the communists, and risks alienating our allies in the republican parties. On the other hand, more left-leaning radicals are being lured to our organizations, away from the communists.

@militant_2
view-if: funded_juventudes >= 1
on-arrival: js_militancy += 0.02; funded_juventudes -= 1

As we have already funded resources towards the Juventudes Socialistas, we can invest in building up their militancy.


@same

The Juventudes Socialistas is already serving the purpose it needs to serve. There is no reason to change what already works.

- @return: Continue...


@cut_js
subtitle: +1 resources
on-arrival: resources += 1; js_strength -= 100; js_militancy -= 0.05; caballeristas_strength -= 2; caballeristas_dissent -= 2; psoe_militancy -= 0.05; workers_pce += 2; unemployed_pce += 2

Cutting resources to the Juventudes Socialistas causes a drop in the membership, and leads some would-be members to join the Communists instead.


@women_js
title: Allow women to join the Juventudes Socialistas.
subtitle: -1 resources - This might cause a backlash from existing members.
choose-if: resources > 0
view-if: womens_rights >= 4
on-arrival: resources -= 1; js_militancy *= 0.85; js_strength += 400; women_in_js = 1; js_militancy += 0.05 if repealed_175; js_militancy += 0.04 if trans_rights; js_militancy += 0.02 if reformed_183;
go-to: homosexual if trans_rights or repealed_175 or reformed_183
max-visits: 1
achievement: women_reichsbanner

The suggestion to allow women into the Juventudes Socialistas is ridiculed by most. But this is an exceptional time, and we need anyone who is willing to join. Thus, we organize specialized units for women, [? if homosexual_rights > 0: and even some covert units for transsexuals and homosexuals ?].

After allowing women to join, the number of comrades who leave is more than balanced out by the number of radicalized women and others who join. However, many of our departed members were veterans, and many of the new members have no experience with military-style training.

@homosexual
achievement: anders_als_die_andern
